  {
   "id": 519806,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/c142d96716de52bd.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by Pinkachu/Planet Coaster)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>Water lillies have leaves that float on the surface of the water.</p>\n<p>Based on this information, make a hypothesis about the stomata on water lilly leaves.</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1014747,
     "content_html": "Water lilly leaves have stomata on both upper and lower leaf surface."
    },
    {
     "id": 1014748,
     "content_html": "Water lilly leaves have stomata only on the upper leaf surface."
    },
    {
     "id": 1014749,
     "content_html": "Water lilly leaves have stomata only on the lower leaf surface."
    },
    {
     "id": 1014750,
     "content_html": "Water lilly leaves have no stomata."
    }
   ],
